{"schema_version":1,"resources":{"locales/kr/ep2/quest_story/12109190.json":{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12109190","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12109190","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1210919001:0":{"text":"트레밀레우스가 단서를 더 남겨주었을까요?","source_cn":"特勒米琉斯还会给我们留线索吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C92DD09FB373084","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1210919002:0":{"text":"그건 모르지. 바람의 신은 어디로 튈지 모르는 성격이거든.","source_cn":"不好说，这位风浪神很随性。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2AA30015539C7574","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:辛巴达":{"text":"신밧드","source":"辛巴达","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":3,"localized_text_count":2,"speaker_count":2}},"locales/kr/ep2/quest_story/12110010.json":{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12110010","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12110010","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1211001001:0":{"text":"친구들, 여기에 곰팡이 핀 노트가 있어. 같이 확인해 보자고.","source_cn":"朋友们，有个发霉的笔记本，捡起看看。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x43DF4C8AA501B171","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:辛巴达":{"text":"신밧드","source":"辛巴达","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":2,"localized_text_count":1,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/kr/ep2/quest_story/12110020.json":{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12110020","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12110020","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1211002001:0":{"text":"로시스는 보물 찾는 걸 도와주고 싶다면서 힌트는 왜 이렇게 모호하게 남긴 걸까요...","source_cn":"罗赛斯既然想帮别人找到宝藏，为什么不把提示写得更清楚一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x415B95E043DADEC6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1211002002:0":{"text":"노트에 바다 얘기가 나온 걸 보면, 다음 시련은 정말 수영과 연관이 있는 걸까요?","source_cn":"笔记提到了海洋，难道下一个试炼真的和游泳有关？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x015B49D0776C0320","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":3,"localized_text_count":2,"speaker_count":2}},"locales/kr/ep2/quest_story/12110030.json":{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12110030","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12110030","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1211003001:0":{"text":"이곳에도 고블린이 있네요... 정말 끈질긴 생명체예요. 어디에 있어도 살아남을 수 있을 것 같아요.","source_cn":"这里也有咕布林，它们可真顽强呀，好像在哪里都能生存。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4688E9B94D59D62D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1211003002:0":{"text":"귀여워! 귀여운 친구들이 나랑 놀고 싶대!","source_cn":"可爱！可爱它们想和我玩！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x09838A71C7E55509","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1211003003:0":{"text":"그건 네 착각이야. 고블린은 널 공격하려는 거라고!","source_cn":"你理解错了，它们是想攻击你！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF24CA4C6C45C7D8C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:奈拉":{"text":"나라","source":"奈拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:辛巴达":{"text":"신밧드","source":"辛巴达","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":3}},"locales/kr/ep2/quest_story/12110040.json":{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12110040","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12110040","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1211004001:1":{"text":"여기 배가 있어요, 신밧드. 이곳이 바로 시련이 시작되는 곳인가요?","source_cn":"这里有船，辛巴达，这里就是开始试炼的地方吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBAB1ED0102488D93","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1211004002:1":{"text":"지정된 시간에 배를 타고 지정된 장소로 가야 하는 것 같은데.","source_cn":"看来应该是要在指定的时间坐船到达指定的地点。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x18AA5FAADEF93952","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1211004003:1":{"text":"해상 레이스였군요?","source_cn":"原来是海上竞速？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x94C743E167F9E0DD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1211004004:1":{"text":"하하, 나중에 육상 레이스까지 해야 할지도 몰라.","source_cn":"哈哈，说不定陆上竞速待会也有呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6B6AB63767BD363A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1211004005:1":{"text":"언니, 우리 같이 배에 타자! 출...발!!","source_cn":"姐姐，我们一起坐船吧！出——发——！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB51F046038B77C5A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:辛巴达":{"text":"신밧드","source":"辛巴达","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:奈拉":{"text":"나라","source":"奈拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":6,"localized_text_count":5,"speaker_count":3}},"locales/kr/ep2/quest_story/12110050.json":{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12110050","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12110050","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1211005001:0":{"text":"자, 다들 꽉 잡아. 파도가 꽤 거치니까 말이야!","source_cn":"都抓稳了，我们要乘风破浪！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCB54928D296522B0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:辛巴达":{"text":"신밧드","source":"辛巴达","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":2,"localized_text_count":1,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/kr/ep2/quest_story/12110060.json":{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12110060","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12110060","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1211006001:0":{"text":"속도를 더 높이면 배가 날게 할 수도 있어!","source_cn":"再快一点，我能让船飞起来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4DD4119E03CDB678","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1211006002:0":{"text":"신난다! 너무 좋아! 계속 언니랑 이렇게 놀고 싶어!","source_cn":"好刺激！我喜欢！我还想玩——和姐姐一直玩下去！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x13F29207DE8E859A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:辛巴达":{"text":"신밧드","source":"辛巴达","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:奈拉":{"text":"나라","source":"奈拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":3,"localized_text_count":2,"speaker_count":2}},"locales/kr/ep2/quest_story/12110070.json":{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12110070","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12110070","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1211007001:0":{"text":"이번 시련은 뭐지? 너무 기대돼!","source_cn":"这次的试炼会是什么呢？好期待啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25050D133FE54940","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:奈拉":{"text":"나라","source":"奈拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":2,"localized_text_count":1,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/kr/ep2/quest_story/12110071.json":{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12110071","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12110071","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1211007101:0":{"text":"와, 우리가 얼마나 빨리 달릴 수 있는지를 시험하는 거였군요!","source_cn":"哇，原来是要测试我们是不是跑得快！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0F529696749243B4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1211007102:0":{"text":"날아가는 게 달리는 것보다 더 빠르지 않을까요?","source_cn":"如果飞过去是不是比跑更快呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A6D8BD35625F1A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":3,"localized_text_count":2,"speaker_count":2}},"locales/kr/ep2/quest_story/12110080.json":{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12110080","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12110080","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1211008001:0":{"text":"힘들어 죽겠네... 예전에 매일 같이 도망 다녔던 경험이 오늘 빛을 발할 줄이야...","source_cn":"累死我了……要不是以前天天被追着打，还真跑不动……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD12F7FCB6C8011A0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:辛巴达":{"text":"신밧드","source":"辛巴达","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":2,"localized_text_count":1,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/kr/timeline/quest_story/12110090.json":{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_12110090","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12110090","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1211009001:1":{"text":"이거 봐! 찾았어!","source_cn":"看！找到了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x032184BDBAABA21F","varia